      "text": "(a) The employer shall ensure the ready availability of medical personnel for advice and consultation on matters of plant health.\n\n",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:a3d2f45cf2d3a2c3b3aa1aea11be16edb0aaae9b6b4a8b0991c243a790dcba0d"
