    {
      "id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:passage:b2b60dce941628ccff7d44fe3d28753b768de19815bd24a808e9bf1d4662365f",
      "source": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:671f8e499260a2e11465cb0d396dbf6e741bba3a2dbd843d1b6fad0fbbee374a",
      "text": "(b) In the absence of an infirmary, clinic, or hospital in near proximity to the workplace which is used for the treatment of all injured employees, a person or persons shall be adequately trained to render first aid. Adequate first aid supplies shall be readily available.\n\n",
      "claim_ids": [
