      "text": "(c) Where the eyes or body of any person may be exposed to injurious corrosive materials, suitable facilities for quick drenching or flushing of the eyes and body shall be provided within the work area for immediate emergency use.\n\n",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:9ca7365a93eda15fc209feb0bf27a2a5145932cffbb8af124c808f3403357413"
